    "market_commentary": "At 6,455 points, the SSY Pacific Capesize Index increased by 599 points week-on-week to an eight-week high. The W.Australia-China iron ore spot voyage rate climbed by $1.35/t to $10.15/t, while there was a $1,850/day rise in the round-voyage rate to $13,000/day.",
